# Lab Tor v3 Onion Service configuration (100% fictional sample testing)
# In production, disable SocksPort (SocksPort 0); in this local lab we bind
# SocksPort strictly to 127.0.0.1:9050 so the in-container E2E test can fetch
# our own live .onion circuit end-to-end over Tor!

DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
Log notice stdout
SafeLogging 1
SocksPort 127.0.0.1:9050

HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/archive_site/
HiddenServiceVersion 3
HiddenServicePort 80 127.0.0.1:8080
HiddenServicePoWDefensesEnabled 1
